WEBVTT

00:16:57.996 --> 00:17:00.621
they'll even start to do something
we call active learning,

00:17:00.829 --> 00:17:02.662
which is where they ask us for exactly

00:17:02.662 --> 00:17:05.038
the data they need when they're missing
something, when they're unsure,

00:17:05.038 --> 00:17:06.038
when they don't understand.

00:17:07.121 --> 00:17:11.663
But I think as a result of simply scaling
these models up, building better,

00:17:11.996 --> 00:17:14.746
I hate to use the word cognition because
it sounds so anthropomorphic,

00:17:14.746 --> 00:17:18.996
but let's say building a better ability
to reason into the models, to think,

00:17:18.996 --> 00:17:21.413
to challenge, to try to understand

00:17:22.079 --> 00:17:27.371
and combining that with this idea of
online into human values via this

00:17:27.371 --> 00:17:30.121
technique we developed, that's
going to go a very long way.